# Paste ONE share link below (first line that is not a comment is used).
# Supported: ss://  vless://  vmess://  trojan://
# Then run start-tun.bat (as administrator) again to apply it.
#
# examples (replace with your own):
# ss://BASE64(method:password)@host:port#name
# vless://uuid@host:443?security=reality&sni=...&fp=chrome&pbk=...&sid=...&type=tcp&flow=xtls-rprx-vision#name
# vmess://BASE64(json)
# trojan://password@host:443?security=tls&sni=host&type=ws&path=/path#name

